# Agent kit

1. Read root `AGENTS.md` (the Agent Kit section) and follow it in order.
2. Before writing code, read the files listed in AGENTS.md §1, one by one.
3. Then follow AGENTS.md §2 and the matching `/agent/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`.
4. After non-trivial work: `/agent/checklist.md` → session-log → `/agent/improvement.md`.
5. Mid-task new chat → `/agent/handoff.md`.
6. After stack changes, remind the user to run `npx @mapl6/agent-kit scan`.

Do not start implementing until the read sequence is done. Do not invent a parallel instruction system.
